==Notes==

*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* The spell description is missing the descriptor (mind-affecting) for the will save.
* A creature with [[improved evasion]] may be wrongly subject to the will save, even when the reflex save is successful. This occurs when the pre-save damage to that creature is 1 (which implies caster level only 3).

